the bosses of levels 5, 10 and 15.Survival: waves that keep coming, up to wave 20.A selection of the fleet, each ship with its own weapon and ultimate. The rest of the hangar is visible, locked, so you can see what is coming.The full game21 ships, a ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691465","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4982990-1842846814454400","game_id":"steam-4982990","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: bosses change shape mid-fight","summary":"WHAT'S NEWThey transform in front of youWhen a boss or a Castaway hits its limit it breaks apart and rebuilds itself without cutting away: new parts grow, the silhouette changes, and it comes out of the transformation with attacks you had not seen. The camera takes a second so you get a good look.Whatever worked a minute ago stops working. This is not the same enemy with more health: it is another enemy wearing the same name.They make an entranceEvery boss and every Castaway arrives with a chore","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T01:46:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814454400","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4982990-1842212951298154","game_id":"steam-4982990","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: the sector comes alive, and the Zephyr arrives","summary":"WHAT'S NEW The sector is full of things Go exploring and you'll find hidden discoveries, nodes that drop scrap when you break them, and explosives you can set off on the horde. Watch where you stand: if you're inside the blast radius, it catches you too. Somewhere out there sits a guarded wreck, watched over by The Reaper, a territorial guardian that patrols its hull and won't chase you across the sector. Beat it and the loot is yours. There's also a Free Station for trading between waves, and p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T21:10:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951298154","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4982990-1841579228669631","game_id":"steam-4982990","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: ship-exclusive cards and three-act bosses","summary":"WHAT'S NEW Every ship has its own cards All four demo ships get two exclusive upgrades each, marked with their badge: they only show up when you're flying that ship. The Talon drops an overcharged round every few shots and every kill gives it a burst of speed; the Vanguard's hits explode in an area and leave the target slowed; the Warden only needs to be hit to recharge its burst and send it back harder; the Onyx gains damage for every enemy it punches through, and its rails bounce to another ta","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T17:53:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228669631","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4982990-1840944183788667","game_id":"steam-4982990","kind":"announcement","title":"New in-run inventory, redesigned HUD, and better on laptops","summary":"WHAT'S NEW In-run inventory Press TAB any time (or open it from the pause menu) to see everything you're carrying: cards, artifacts, relics, evolutions, your family synergies and your real stats. Every piece has its own artwork and a frame matching its rarity, so you can read your build at a glance. Three quality presets Quality, Balanced and Performance. 